          "id": "01K4JP3VDVXVRFJ19Z0VDFKH3R"
        }
      ],
      "value": "{R} You may spend 1 of my boosts to have target Character gain [[Asleep]]. (During Dusk, ignore its statistics. During Rest, it doesn't go to Reserve and it loses Asleep.)",
